{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/layout/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Layout","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Give your forms some structure—from inline to horizontal to custom grid implementations—with our form layout options."},"blocks":[{"id":"forms","type":"heading","en":"Forms","level":2},{"id":"forms--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Every group of form fields should reside in a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> element. Bootstrap provides no default styling for the <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> element, but there are some powerful browser features that are provided by default."},{"id":"forms--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-1","type":"item","en":"New to browser forms? Consider reviewing <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/form\">the MDN form docs</a> for an overview and complete list of available attributes."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;button&gt;</code>s within a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> default to <code>type=&quot;submit&quot;</code>, so strive to be specific and always include a <code>type</code>."}]}]},{"id":"forms--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Since Bootstrap applies <code>display: block</code> and <code>width: 100%</code> to almost all our form controls, forms will by default stack vertically. Additional classes can be used to vary this layout on a per-form basis."},{"id":"utilities","type":"heading","en":"Utilities","level":2},{"id":"utilities--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/margin\">Margin utilities</a> are the easiest way to add some structure to forms. They provide basic grouping of labels, controls, optional form text, and form validation messaging. We recommend sticking to <code>margin-bottom</code> utilities, and using a single direction throughout the form for consistency."},{"id":"utilities--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Feel free to build your forms however you like, with <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>s, <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>s, or nearly any other element."},{"id":"utilities--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e64f0517c301be0e92be","height":174,"anchors":["formGroupExampleInput","formGroupExampleInput2"]},{"id":"utilities--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formGroupExampleInput\" class=\"form-label\">Example label</label>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"formGroupExampleInput\" placeholder=\"Example input placeholder\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formGroupExampleInput2\" class=\"form-label\">Another label</label>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"formGroupExampleInput2\" placeholder=\"Another input placeholder\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"form-grid","type":"heading","en":"Form grid","level":2},{"id":"form-grid--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"More complex forms can be built using our grid classes. Use these for form layouts that require multiple columns, varied widths, and additional alignment options. <strong>Requires the <code>$enable-grid-classes</code> Sass variable to be enabled</strong> (on by default)."},{"id":"form-grid--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7da8c4d3fc4ba3c19833","height":147},{"id":"form-grid--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"First name\" aria-label=\"First name\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Last name\" aria-label=\"Last name\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"gutters","type":"heading","en":"Gutters","level":2},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"By adding <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/layout/gutters\">gutter modifier classes</a>, you can have control over the gutter width in as well the inline as block direction. <strong>Also requires the <code>$enable-grid-classes</code> Sass variable to be enabled</strong> (on by default)."},{"id":"gutters--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b1dc7ae339b915cc2dfe","height":147},{"id":"gutters--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"First name\" aria-label=\"First name\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Last name\" aria-label=\"Last name\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"More complex layouts can also be created with the grid system."},{"id":"gutters--example-2","type":"demo","key":"95c14662fff22f702def","height":300,"anchors":["inputEmail4","inputPassword4","inputAddress","inputAddress2","inputCity","inputState","inputZip","gridCheck"]},{"id":"gutters--code-2","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"md:col-6\">\n    <label for=\"inputEmail4\" class=\"form-label\">Email</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputEmail4\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col-6\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword4\" class=\"form-label\">Password</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword4\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label for=\"inputAddress\" class=\"form-label\">Address</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputAddress\" placeholder=\"1234 Main St\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label for=\"inputAddress2\" class=\"form-label\">Address 2</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputAddress2\" placeholder=\"Apartment, studio, or floor\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col-6\">\n    <label for=\"inputCity\" class=\"form-label\">City</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputCity\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col-4\">\n    <label for=\"inputState\" class=\"form-label\">State</label>\n    <select id=\"inputState\" class=\"form-control\">\n      <option selected>Choose...</option>\n      <option>...</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col-2\">\n    <label for=\"inputZip\" class=\"form-label\">Zip</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputZip\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"gridCheck\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"gridCheck\">\n        Check me out\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\">Sign in</button>\n  </div>\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal-form","type":"heading","en":"Horizontal form","level":2},{"id":"horizontal-form--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Create horizontal forms with the grid by adding the <code>.row</code> class to form groups and using <code>.{breakpoint}:col-*</code> classes (e.g. <code>.sm:col-2</code>) to specify the width of your labels and controls. Be sure to add <code>.col-form-label</code> to your <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s as well so they’re vertically centered with their associated form controls."},{"id":"horizontal-form--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"At times, you maybe need to use margin or padding utilities to create that perfect alignment you need. For example, we’ve removed the <code>padding-top</code> on our stacked radio inputs label to better align the text baseline."},{"id":"horizontal-form--example-1","type":"demo","key":"34a8b9f84a2b1a4781f8","height":300,"anchors":["inputEmail3","inputPassword3","gridRadios1","gridRadios2","gridRadios3","gridCheck1"]},{"id":"horizontal-form--code-1","type":"code","value":"<form>\n  <div class=\"row mb-3\">\n    <label for=\"inputEmail3\" class=\"sm:col-2 col-form-label\">Email</label>\n    <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n      <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputEmail3\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row mb-3\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword3\" class=\"sm:col-2 col-form-label\">Password</label>\n    <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n      <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword3\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <fieldset class=\"row mb-3\">\n    <legend class=\"col-form-label sm:col-2 pt-0\">Radios</legend>\n    <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-field mb-1\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gridRadios\" id=\"gridRadios1\" value=\"option1\" class=\"radio\" checked>\n          <label for=\"gridRadios1\">\n            First radio\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-field mb-1\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gridRadios\" id=\"gridRadios2\" value=\"option2\" class=\"radio\">\n          <label for=\"gridRadios2\">\n            Second radio\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-field\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gridRadios\" id=\"gridRadios3\" value=\"option3\" class=\"radio\" disabled>\n          <label for=\"gridRadios3\">\n            Third disabled radio\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </fieldset>\n  <div class=\"row mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"sm:col-10 sm:offset-2\">\n      <div class=\"form-field\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"gridCheck1\" class=\"check\">\n        <label for=\"gridCheck1\">\n          Example checkbox\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\">Sign in</button>\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal-form-label-sizing","type":"heading","en":"Horizontal form label sizing","level":3},{"id":"horizontal-form-label-sizing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Be sure to use <code>.col-form-label-sm</code> or <code>.col-form-label-lg</code> to your <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s or <code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>s to correctly follow the size of <code>.form-control-lg</code> and <code>.form-control-sm</code>."},{"id":"horizontal-form-label-sizing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fb95bb985b6e504435f5","height":201,"anchors":["colFormLabelSm","colFormLabel","colFormLabelLg"]},{"id":"horizontal-form-label-sizing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"colFormLabelSm\" class=\"sm:col-2 col-form-label col-form-label-sm\">Email</label>\n  <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" id=\"colFormLabelSm\" placeholder=\"col-form-label-sm\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"colFormLabel\" class=\"sm:col-2 col-form-label\">Email</label>\n  <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"colFormLabel\" placeholder=\"col-form-label\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <label for=\"colFormLabelLg\" class=\"sm:col-2 col-form-label col-form-label-lg\">Email</label>\n  <div class=\"sm:col-10\">\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control form-control-lg\" id=\"colFormLabelLg\" placeholder=\"col-form-label-lg\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"column-sizing","type":"heading","en":"Column sizing","level":2},{"id":"column-sizing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"As shown in the previous examples, our grid system allows you to place any number of <code>.col</code>s within a <code>.row</code>. They’ll split the available width equally between them. You may also pick a subset of your columns to take up more or less space, while the remaining <code>.col</code>s equally split the rest, with specific column classes like <code>.sm:col-7</code>."},{"id":"column-sizing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e478e0bcca383565d056","height":147},{"id":"column-sizing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"sm:col-7\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"City\" aria-label=\"City\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sm:col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"State\" aria-label=\"State\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sm:col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Zip\" aria-label=\"Zip\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"auto-sizing","type":"heading","en":"Auto-sizing","level":2},{"id":"auto-sizing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The example below uses a flexbox utility to vertically center the contents and changes <code>.col</code> to <code>.col-auto</code> so that your columns only take up as much space as needed. Put another way, the column sizes itself based on the contents."},{"id":"auto-sizing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"82ef95d7a9a9f623a98e","height":300,"anchors":["autoSizingInput","autoSizingInputGroup","autoSizingSelect","autoSizingCheck"]},{"id":"auto-sizing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"row gy-2 gx-3 align-items-center\">\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"autoSizingInput\">Name</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"autoSizingInput\" placeholder=\"Jane Doe\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"autoSizingInputGroup\">Username</label>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <div class=\"input-group-text\">@</div>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"autoSizingInputGroup\" placeholder=\"Username\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"autoSizingSelect\">Preference</label>\n    <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"autoSizingSelect\">\n      <option selected>Choose...</option>\n      <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n      <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"autoSizingCheck\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"autoSizingCheck\">\n        Remember me\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\">Submit</button>\n  </div>\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"auto-sizing--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can then remix that once again with size-specific column classes."},{"id":"auto-sizing--example-2","type":"demo","key":"75898db74e8e2710c2da","height":300,"anchors":["specificSizeInputName","specificSizeInputGroupUsername","specificSizeSelect","autoSizingCheck2"]},{"id":"auto-sizing--code-2","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"row gx-3 gy-2 align-items-center\">\n  <div class=\"sm:col-3\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"specificSizeInputName\">Name</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"specificSizeInputName\" placeholder=\"Jane Doe\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sm:col-3\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"specificSizeInputGroupUsername\">Username</label>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <div class=\"input-group-text\">@</div>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"specificSizeInputGroupUsername\" placeholder=\"Username\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sm:col-3\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"specificSizeSelect\">Preference</label>\n    <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"specificSizeSelect\">\n      <option selected>Choose...</option>\n      <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n      <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"autoSizingCheck2\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"autoSizingCheck2\">\n        Remember me\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\">Submit</button>\n  </div>\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"inline-forms","type":"heading","en":"Inline forms","level":2},{"id":"inline-forms--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the <code>.row-cols-*</code> classes to create responsive horizontal layouts. By adding <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/layout/gutters\">gutter modifier classes</a>, we’ll have gutters in horizontal and vertical directions. On narrow mobile viewports, the <code>.col-12</code> helps stack the form controls and more. The <code>.align-items-center</code> aligns the form elements to the middle, making checkboxes and labels align properly."},{"id":"inline-forms--example-1","type":"demo","key":"214704010d2f6a699b61","height":300,"anchors":["inlineFormInputGroupUsername","inlineFormSelectPref","inlineFormCheck"]},{"id":"inline-forms--code-1","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"row lg:row-cols-auto g-3 align-items-center\">\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"inlineFormInputGroupUsername\">Username</label>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <div class=\"input-group-text\">@</div>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inlineFormInputGroupUsername\" placeholder=\"Username\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"inlineFormSelectPref\">Preference</label>\n    <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"inlineFormSelectPref\">\n      <option selected>Choose...</option>\n      <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n      <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"inlineFormCheck\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"inlineFormCheck\">\n        Remember me\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\">Submit</button>\n  </div>\n</form>","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"e64f0517c301be0e92be","html":"<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formGroupExampleInput\" class=\"form-label\">Example label</label>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"formGroupExampleInput\" placeholder=\"Example input placeholder\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formGroupExampleInput2\" class=\"form-label\">Another label</label>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"formGroupExampleInput2\" placeholder=\"Another input placeholder\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7da8c4d3fc4ba3c19833","html":"<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"First name\" aria-label=\"First name\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Last name\" aria-label=\"Last name\">\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b1dc7ae339b915cc2dfe","html":"<div class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"First name\" aria-label=\"First name\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Last name\" aria-label=\"Last name\">\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"95c14662fff22f702def","html":"<form class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"md:col-6\">\n    <label for=\"inputEmail4\" class=\"form-label\">Email</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputEmail4\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col-6\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword4\" class=\"form-label\">Password</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword4\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label for=\"inputAddress\" class=\"form-label\">Address</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputAddress\" placeholder=\"1234 Main St\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-12\">\n    <label for=\"inputAddress2\" class=\"form-label\">Address 2</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputAddress2\" placeholder=\"Apartment, studio, or floor\">\n  </div>